OL,3,GNEWSADouble mini-roundabout 'causing
OL,4,Aunnecessary risks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a double
OL,7,Fmini-roundabout have described crashes
OL,8,Fand near misses there, as plans are
OL,9,Fbeing made to replace it.
OL,11,FA consultation has started over
OL,12,FWestmorland and Furness Council's plans
OL,13,Fto change the "complicated" junction at
OL,14,FSandgate in Penrith, which the
OL,15,Fauthority said confused motorists and
OL,16,Facted as a barrier for pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
