OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADouble mini-roundabout 'causing
OL,4,Aunnecessary risks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulian Shaw, 78, said "poor signage and
OL,7,Fconfusion over where drivers should
OL,8,Fstop had created unnecessary risks",
OL,9,Fwhile another resident said he had
OL,10,F"witnessed several near misses and an
OL,11,Faccident at the junction".
OL,13,FHowever a woman told the BBC she
OL,14,Fthought the "layout should remain, but
OL,15,Fclearer road markings and better
OL,16,Fpedestrian crossings would be good".
